stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> GitMetadataPrune
    GitMetadataPrune: git worktree prune --verbose
    GitMetadataPrune --> EnumerateCandidates: metadata prune complete
    EnumerateCandidates: enumerate candidates except HEAD
    EnumerateCandidates --> RegistryCheck: check each repository relative candidate
    EnumerateCandidates --> [*]: no candidates
    RegistryCheck: worktree_protection.py check
    RegistryCheck --> FailClosed: nonzero, unparseable, missing, malformed, unreadable, aliased, or invalid registry
    RegistryCheck --> CandidateIdentity: valid v1 registry at ignored .worktrees/worktree-protection.json
    CandidateIdentity: resolve paths inside repository .worktrees and compare canonical identities
    CandidateIdentity --> FailClosed: path escape or duplicate canonical identity
    CandidateIdentity --> ProtectionDecision
    ProtectionDecision --> ProtectedSkip: canonical identity is protected
    ProtectedSkip: skip removal and report owner, purpose, review metadata
    ProtectedSkip --> NextCandidate
    ProtectionDecision --> EligibilityCheck: unprotected only
    EligibilityCheck --> KeepCandidate: dirty, unmerged to main, or last commit within 7 days
    EligibilityCheck --> FinalRecheck: clean, merged to main, last commit older than 7 days
    FinalRecheck: rerun registry check immediately before removal
    FinalRecheck --> FailClosed: error or status is not unprotected
    FinalRecheck --> RemoveCandidate: status remains unprotected
    RemoveCandidate: remove candidate worktree directory
    RemoveCandidate --> NextCandidate
    KeepCandidate --> NextCandidate
    NextCandidate --> RegistryCheck: another candidate
    NextCandidate --> [*]: no more candidates
    FailClosed: stop removals for this repository and flag the issue
    FailClosed --> [*]
    note right of GitMetadataPrune
        Git metadata only. This does not remove candidate directories
        or replace the separate registry removal gate.
    end note

    class GitMetadataPrune,EnumerateCandidates,RegistryCheck,CandidateIdentity,ProtectionDecision,EligibilityCheck,FinalRecheck,RemoveCandidate ws
    class ProtectedSkip,KeepCandidate,FailClosed state

classDef ws fill:#1a3a30,stroke:#6ad4b4,color:#d0f8ee
